{"ref":"BDB, מאץ","hw":"מאץ","html":"<big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">מאץ</span></big></big>  <strong>(</strong>cf. Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">مَأَصٌ</span> a kind of <em>white</em> camel, whence Lag<sup>BN29</sup> proposes <span dir=\"rtl\">מָאֹץ</span> for the difficult <span dir=\"rtl\">אָמֹץ (אֲמֻצִּים)</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 6:3\" href=\"/Zechariah.6.3\">Zc 6:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 6:7\" href=\"/Zechariah.6.7\">7</a><strong>)</strong>.","next":"BDB, מָאַר","prev":"BDB, מַאֲפֵל²"}